---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Lessons — IELTS Corner"
  description="Free lessons for IELTS & CELPIP: Grammar, Vocabulary, and skill-specific training for Listening, Reading, Speaking, and Writing."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="hero" style={`--hero-bg: url('/heroes/lesson.png');`}>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="pill">📚 Lessons</span>

        <h1>Pick your test. Pick your skill. Practice properly.</h1>

        <p class="muted" style="max-width: 58ch;">
          Free lessons for IELTS and CELPIP — clear steps, good examples, and practice that makes sense.
        </p>

        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/ielts">IELTS lessons →</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/lessons/celpip">CELPIP lessons →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <!-- Core language categories -->
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Grammar</h3>
        <p class="muted">These grammar lessons focus on high-impact structures that improve accuracy and raise your score.</p>
        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/grammar">Open grammar →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>Vocabulary</h3>
        <p class="muted">These vocabulary lessons teach useful words and word groups for real English and exam tasks.</p>
        <div class="cluster">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/lessons/vocabulary">Open vocabulary →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <!-- CELPIP lessons block -->
    <div class="surface feature">
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="stack">
          <h2>CELPIP lessons</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="max-width: 58ch;">
            Practice each CELPIP skill with simple steps, templates, and examples.
          </p>
          <div class="cluster">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/celpip">CELPIP course page →</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/tutoring">Private / group lessons →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
          <a class="card" href="/celpip/listening" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Listening</h3>
            <p class="muted">You will learn how to understand questions quickly and choose accurate answers under time pressure.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="card" href="/celpip/reading" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Reading</h3>
            <p class="muted">You will practice scanning, keyword tracking, and evidence-based choices to avoid wrong options.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="card" href="/celpip/speaking" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Speaking</h3>
            <p class="muted">You will use practical templates for each task while developing natural and confident delivery.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="card" href="/celpip/writing" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Writing</h3>
            <p class="muted">You will learn reusable structures for both the email task and the survey response task.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <!-- IELTS lessons block -->
    <div class="surface feature">
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <div class="stack">
          <h2>IELTS lessons</h2>
          <p class="muted" style="max-width: 58ch;">
            IELTS lessons are here — but for now, the main path is coaching (to get to Band 7+ faster).
          </p>
          <div class="cluster">
            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tutoring">Go to tutoring →</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/ielts">IELTS page →</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-2" style="gap: var(--s-4);">
          <a class="card" href="/lessons/ielts/listening" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Listening</h3>
            <p class="muted">These lessons help you improve listening accuracy and avoid common exam traps.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="card" href="/lessons/ielts/reading" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Reading</h3>
            <p class="muted">You will train time control, keyword tracking, and a clear answer-selection strategy.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="card" href="/lessons/ielts/speaking" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Speaking</h3>
            <p class="muted">You will practice natural answers that still maintain strong and consistent structure.</p>
          </a>

          <a class="card" href="/lessons/ielts/writing" style="text-decoration:none;">
            <h3>Writing</h3>
            <p class="muted">These writing lessons teach Band 7+ structure with clear flow, appropriate tone, and precise language.</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="height: var(--s-8);"></div>

    <!-- gentle conversion -->
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Want faster progress?</h3>
        <p class="muted">One focused lesson with feedback can save you weeks of guessing and repeated mistakes.</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tutoring">View pricing →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>CELPIP course</h3>
        <p class="muted">Start now with a guided plan, practical templates, and skill-by-skill practice.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/celpip">Go to course page →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
